      "description": "受控输入的外观预览；当前最小高度仍为普通尺寸。",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" aria-label=\"搜索短剧\" placeholder=\"搜索短剧\" value=\"重生\">",
      "css": ".ds-search{--ds-card:#ffffff;--ds-foreground:#20211f;--ds-primary:#c52e39;--ds-primary-foreground:#ffffff;--ds-accent:#fbe8e9;--ds-border:#dedfd9;--ds-input:#d0d2cb;--ds-ring:#b42130;--ds-muted:#efefed;--ds-muted-foreground:#686a64;--ds-background:#f8f8f7;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-search{--ds-card:#20231f;--ds-foreground:#f3f4ef;--ds-primary:#f2777d;--ds-primary-foreground:#311216;--ds-accent:#42282a;--ds-border:#383e35;--ds-input:#50584a;--ds-ring:#ffa6ab;--ds-muted:#292d27;--ds-muted-foreground:#a6ada0;--ds-background:#161816;}}.ds-search{box-sizing:border-box;min-height:48px;max-width:100%;width:320px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--ds-input);border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-card);color:var(--ds-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-search:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--ds-ring);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "信息容器",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "surface",
      "description": "Surface 的边界与间距；该示例无交互，不虚构 hover/focus 状态。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-surface\"><strong>短剧详情</strong><span>查看简介与选集</span></section>",
      "css": ".ds-surface{--ds-card:#ffffff;--ds-foreground:#20211f;--ds-primary:#c52e39;--ds-primary-foreground:#ffffff;--ds-accent:#fbe8e9;--ds-border:#dedfd9;--ds-input:#d0d2cb;--ds-ring:#b42130;--ds-muted:#efefed;--ds-muted-foreground:#686a64;--ds-background:#f8f8f7;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-surface{--ds-card:#20231f;--ds-foreground:#f3f4ef;--ds-primary:#f2777d;--ds-primary-foreground:#311216;--ds-accent:#42282a;--ds-border:#383e35;--ds-input:#50584a;--ds-ring:#ffa6ab;--ds-muted:#292d27;--ds-muted-foreground:#a6ada0;--ds-background:#161816;}}.ds-surface{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--ds-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-card);color:var(--ds-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-surface strong{font-weight:600;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "邻近提示",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "notice",
      "description": "普通说明状态。错误角色依赖 NSH 默认主题，未猜测其颜色。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-notice\" role=\"status\">输入剧名，找到下一部想追的短剧。</section>",
      "css": ".ds-notice{--ds-card:#ffffff;--ds-foreground:#20211f;--ds-primary:#c52e39;--ds-primary-foreground:#ffffff;--ds-accent:#fbe8e9;--ds-border:#dedfd9;--ds-input:#d0d2cb;--ds-ring:#b42130;--ds-muted:#efefed;--ds-muted-foreground:#686a64;--ds-background:#f8f8f7;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-notice{--ds-card:#20231f;--ds-foreground:#f3f4ef;--ds-primary:#f2777d;--ds-primary-foreground:#311216;--ds-accent:#42282a;--ds-border:#383e35;--ds-input:#50584a;--ds-ring:#ffa6ab;--ds-muted:#292d27;--ds-muted-foreground:#a6ada0;--ds-background:#161816;}}.ds-notice{padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--ds-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-card);color:var(--ds-muted-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "结果卡片",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "result-card",
      "description": "示意内容与加载占位，不使用真实作品作固定承诺；实际 NSH 通过语义 Button 管理交互。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-result\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-result-poster\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ds-result-copy\"><strong>短剧名称</strong><small>剧集信息</small><span>查看详情与选集</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-result{--ds-card:#ffffff;--ds-foreground:#20211f;--ds-primary:#c52e39;--ds-primary-foreground:#ffffff;--ds-accent:#fbe8e9;--ds-border:#dedfd9;--ds-input:#d0d2cb;--ds-ring:#b42130;--ds-muted:#efefed;--ds-muted-foreground:#686a64;--ds-background:#f8f8f7;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-result{--ds-card:#20231f;--ds-foreground:#f3f4ef;--ds-primary:#f2777d;--ds-primary-foreground:#311216;--ds-accent:#42282a;--ds-border:#383e35;--ds-input:#50584a;--ds-ring:#ffa6ab;--ds-muted:#292d27;--ds-muted-foreground:#a6ada0;--ds-background:#161816;}}.ds-result{display:flex;gap:20px;width:100%;padding:16px;text-align:start;border:2px solid var(--ds-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-card);color:var(--ds-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-result:hover{background:var(--ds-muted);}.ds-result:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ds-ring);}.ds-result:active{opacity:.7;}.ds-result-poster{flex-shrink:0;width:80px;height:112px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-muted);}.ds-result-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}.ds-result-copy strong{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;}.ds-result-copy small{font-size:14px;color:var(--ds-muted-foreground);}.ds-result-copy>span{color:var(--ds-muted-foreground);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "顶部导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "header-navigation",
      "description": "当前验证界面的共享顶栏；不代表上游侧栏已迁移。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主导航\"><strong class=\"ds-nav-title\">红果</strong><button class=\"ds-nav-action\" type=\"button\">继续观看</button><button class=\"ds-nav-action\" type=\"button\">账号</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{--ds-card:#ffffff;--ds-foreground:#20211f;--ds-primary:#c52e39;--ds-primary-foreground:#ffffff;--ds-accent:#fbe8e9;--ds-border:#dedfd9;--ds-input:#d0d2cb;--ds-ring:#b42130;--ds-muted:#efefed;--ds-muted-foreground:#686a64;--ds-background:#f8f8f7;}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){.ds-nav{--ds-card:#20231f;--ds-foreground:#f3f4ef;--ds-primary:#f2777d;--ds-primary-foreground:#311216;--ds-accent:#42282a;--ds-border:#383e35;--ds-input:#50584a;--ds-ring:#ffa6ab;--ds-muted:#292d27;--ds-muted-foreground:#a6ada0;--ds-background:#161816;}}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:12px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ds-border);background:var(--ds-background);color:var(--ds-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-nav-title{flex:1;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;}.ds-nav-action{min-height:48px;padding:12px 16px;border:2px solid var(--ds-border);border-radius:12px;background:var(--ds-card);color:var(--ds-foreground);font:400 16px system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;}.ds-nav-action:hover{background:var(--ds-accent);}.ds-nav-action:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ds-ring);}.ds-nav-action:active{opacity:.7;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "日常片库",
    "overview": "内容优先、清晰克制。用户容易找到想看的短剧，也容易接着上次的进度观看。封面、剧名与明确的操作建立层级，界面减少装饰，不让工程细节和重复说明占据注意力。\n\n清楚、克制、可操作；圆角柔和，状态明确。浅色采用暖白背景与深红主操作，深色采用墨绿灰背景与珊瑚红主操作。通过底色、留白和边界区分内容，不以投影制造层次。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "同一套语义主题覆盖浅色和深色，主要操作使用单一红色强调。",
      "顶部导航、纵向内容流和横向结果卡片组成当前验证界面。",
      "统一圆角、稳定边界和语义控件，让键鼠与遥控输入具有可识别的状态。",
      "内容到达时使用轻量入场，播放读数和操作标签即时更新。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Color Rule",
        "body": "页面只消费语义 token；原始色值只在主题定义，文档和预览数据是提取结果。选中、键盘焦点、错误和主要操作各自保留含义。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Stable Geometry Rule",
        "body": "悬停、按下、选中与焦点变化不改变控件占位；滚动和返回保留卡片身份、列表位置和来源焦点。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "不为当前基础组件额外增加浮起效果；确需新增弹层的后续功能，应先定义其共享表面与焦点行为，而不是为单个页面临时加阴影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 从共享主题、语义控件和现有间距档位组合界面，先扩展共享组件再添加新的外观变体。",
      "**Do** 保留输入、列表位置、卡片身份和实际观看进度；错误紧邻相关操作，并提供可恢复路径。",
      "**Do** 将焦点、选中、禁用和错误分别表达，让键盘与遥控器用户都能辨认当前操作位置。",
      "**Do** 在浅色、深色、窄窗口、更大系统字体和减少动态效果下检查真实宿主，分别记录未验证项。",
      "**Do** 让文案直接描述动作与结果，中文短标签不加重复说明，输入和长标题有明确换行或截断规则。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 在页面里散落原始色值、增加单页圆角或用阴影和装饰性标签堆叠层级。",
      "**Don't** 在 hover、按下或焦点时改变边界宽度、字号或布局尺寸，让邻近内容跳动。",
      "**Don't** 把 Android 放大样式、历史截图或 headless 测试当成 TV 遥控、解码、独立包或完整无障碍验收。",
      "**Don't** 为记录现状而虚构未实现的侧栏、推荐流、抽屉、评论、尺寸变体或完整主题状态。",
      "**Don't** 让焦点落在隐藏控件上、用方向键全局截获文本编辑，或只靠颜色、声音和动画表达状态。"
    ]
  }
}
